---
import { contactInfo } from '../config/contact';
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8">
		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white">NOMI SMART</h2>
			<p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
				Estrategia, contenido y capacitación para marcas que quieren comunicar con claridad, crecer con intención y convertir mejor.
			</p>
		</section>

		<nav class="space-y-4" aria-label="Enlaces rápidos">
			<h2 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white">Enlaces rápidos</h2>
			<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/">Inicio</a></li>
				<li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/servicios">Servicios</a></li>
				<li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
				<li><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/contacto">Contacto</a></li>
			</ul>
		</nav>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white">Contacto y redes</h2>
			<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<li>
					<a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 transition hover:text-white" href={`mailto:${contactInfo.email}`}>
						<svg class="h-4 w-4 text-sky-300 transition group-hover:text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M4 5h16v14H4z" /><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6" />
						</svg>
						<span>{contactInfo.email}</span>
					</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 transition hover:text-white" href={contactInfo.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						<svg class="h-4 w-4 text-pink-300 transition group-hover:text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
							<rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r=".7" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
						</svg>
						<span>Instagram</span>
					</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 transition hover:text-white" href={contactInfo.whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						<svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-300 transition group-hover:text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M20 11.5a8 8 0 0 1-11.8 7L4 20l1.5-4.1A8 8 0 1 1 20 11.5Z" /><path d="M8.5 9.2c.2 2 2.3 4.1 4.3 4.3l1.1-1.1 1.7.7c.2.1.3.3.2.5-.3 1-1 1.5-2 1.3-3.1-.5-5-2.4-5.5-5.2-.2-1 .4-1.7 1.3-2 .2-.1.4 0 .5.2l.7 1.7-1.1 1.1Z" />
						</svg>
						<span>WhatsApp {contactInfo.whatsappContact}</span>
					</a>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</div>

	<div class="border-t border-white/10">
		<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-400 sm:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:px-8">
			<p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} NOMI SMART. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:items-end">
				<p>Hecho para crear contenido útil, simple y consistente.</p>
				<a
					href="https://jatc.dev"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					aria-label="Desarrollado por jatc.dev, abrir en una nueva pestaña"
					class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 transition hover:text-slate-200 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4"
				>
					Desarrollado por jatc.dev
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>